            <div xml:id="d604">

                <pb facs="0636" n="528" sameAs="frus:frus1927v02/pg528"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">033.3711/77: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Cuban Secretary of State</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Ortiz</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1927-05-07"><hi rendition="#italic">May 7,
                        1927</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 6:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>The President of the Republic on returning to Cuba has brought his people the
                    best impressions of the honors and courtesies extended to him while in your
                    country. In the name of the Government and People of Cuba I wish to convey to
                    you our sincere and deepest appreciation.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Rafael Martínez
                    Ortiz</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
